WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:02.240
Get ready for what's coming.

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:05.780
More speed, more of everything.

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:13.220
This is my last chance, 
if I lose I never get to do this again.

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:17.940
Don't fear failure.

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:21.520
Be afraid of not having the chance,
you have the chance.

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:32.800
You'll never be the racer you once were.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:36.060
You can't turn back the clock kid.

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:39.840
But you can wind it up again.

00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:41.460
Don't you worry, pal.

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:43.400
You had a good run.

00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:46.960
I'm coming for you Storm.

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:51.000
Alright turn up the heat.

00:00:51.620 --> 00:00:52.940
You are not winning this.

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:55.020
I decide when I'm done.

